{% extends "eng/_layout.txt.j2" %}
{#- ENCRYPTED_PDF - ingestion: password-protected PDF; we never guess a password -#}
{% block subject %}Your PDF is password protected, so we could not read it{% endblock %}
{% block defect %}The PDF attached to your message is protected by a password. We do not
open protected files and we never try to guess a password, so none of the
pages could be read.{% endblock %}
{% block remedy %}Please remove the password and send the unprotected copy. In most PDF
readers this is done from the File menu, with "Save a copy" or "Print to
PDF", choosing not to set a password on the new file. Please do not send us
the password itself — we will not use it.{% endblock %}
